{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年74歲的施南生近日傳出病重留院的消息，張艾嘉、俞琤、林青霞等好友先後現身醫院探望。前夫徐克今日（9日）傍晚現身醫院，在門口接受傳媒訪問時表示：「畀啲時間佢，要空間去休息，多謝大家關心。」現場有記者問到徐克自己的狀況，他表示：「OK」。</p><figure><img alt=\"徐克到達醫院。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260709/1151971553043419136534169.jpeg/tN_tPSEZI3CQRLmsisdHEsVUQ_rppTT_rk_iyphP4so\"/><figcaption>徐克到達醫院。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐克接受訪問。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260709/1151971549994029056823451.jpeg/UfDuPxIYZ1qUfcpdrWkdE4HKfWvpX8kQaFRjMF5UYzA\"/><figcaption>徐克接受訪問。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"施南生與徐克。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260709/1151968202893299712897254.jpeg/FAwbhAURH5XVsDF2ldvG8vypUJJUkq88iEu1Z4hLtWc\"/><figcaption>施南生與徐克。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-09T11:39:22.811223+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":3,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}